.TH "JSONKIT\-KEYS" "1" "" "jsonkit 0.0.0" ""
.SH "NAME"
jsonkit\-keys \- List the keys at a path.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
\fBjsonkit keys\fR [path] [options]
.fi
.SH "ARGUMENTS"
.TP
\fIpath\fR
Dot path to list. Omit it for the root.
.SH "OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-file\fR <\fIpath\fR>
The document to read. Omit it to read piped text.  (file or piped stdin; \- selects stdin, required)
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBjsonkit\fR(1)
